event('baghdad','Baghdad becomes a new capital',762,762,'762 CE','West Asia','Cities','Baghdad','The Met identifies 762 as the foundation of Baghdad as the new Abbasid capital.',AB,'The record concerns the Abbasid city, not the first human settlement in the area.')
