event('samarra','Samarra serves as an Abbasid capital',836,892,'836–892 CE','West Asia','Architecture','Samarra','Samarra replaced Baghdad as capital for a period dated 836–892 by the Met.',AB,'A span of capital status, not a single construction date.')
