event('cairo','The medieval city of Cairo takes shape',901,1000,'10th century CE','North Africa','Cities','Cairo','UNESCO dates the foundation of Islamic Cairo to the tenth century.',unesco(89),'The label describes a historical urban foundation, not the beginning of habitation in the region.')
