pack('truthful-repair','A truthful repair','5–7','Honesty',10,'Which habit does the report praise?','Truthfulness.',['Inventing a convenient story.','Blaming someone without knowing.'],'The report connects truthfulness with righteousness.','A fictional cup breaks. What is a truthful way to tell a grown-up without blaming someone else?','Take turns offering a simple honest explanation. Use imaginary events and do not handle broken objects.','What makes an explanation clear and kind?',report=('bukhari:6094','The report distinguishes habits of truthfulness from habits of lying.'),teaching='The broken cup is a fictional practice prompt, not a test of a child’s character.')
